# ============================================================
# Representative O-Prime audit log.
# Structure and vocabulary mirror exactly what the gateway emits
# (gateway.mjs writeAccessLog): a root prov:Activity carrying the
# ODRL Compliance Report Model deontic states, plus fields /
# policy-evaluation / violation / duty sub-bundles.
#
# Coverage:
#   - R1-R6:  Health-record scenario (6 access records)
#             Pod: alice, Target: schema:bloodType
#   - R7-R13: University/student-record scenario (7 access records)
#             Pod: student-app-5afw, Target: schema:Person
#             URL: https://student-app-5afw.vercel.app/
#   - All 7 constraint dimensions covered in both scenarios
#   - All 14 SPARQL competency questions return non-empty results
# ============================================================

ex:access-log a prov:Collection .


